{title: Tu Hi Hai Aashiqui}
{artist: Arijit Singh}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Tu hi hai aashiqui,        [G]Tu hi awaaragi
[F]Tu hi hai [Em]zindagi,        [Am]Tu hi judaa
[Am]Tu ibtedaa meri,        [G]Tu intehaa meri
[F]Tu hi mera jahaan,        [Am]Tu hi judaa
[C]Tu mere rubaroo,        [Dm]Har shay mein tu hi tu
[F]Tu pehli aarzoo,        Tu hi [Em]judaa
[Am]Dil ne kahaa tha na [G]tadpega,        Phir [Em]aaj dil dhadke [F]kyun jaaye
[Am]Khwaabon ne tay kiya tha [G]khona,        Phir [Em]aaj kyun palat [F]woh aaye
[C]Tujhme likha hoon main,        [Dm]Tujhse juda hoon main
[F]Tu mera rog hai,        Tu hi [Em]dawaa
[Am]Tu hi hai aashiqui,        [G]Tu hi awaaragi
[F]Tu hi hai [Em]zindagi,        [Am]Tu hi judaa
[Am]Aadhi hai rehguzar,        [C]Aadha hai aasmaan
[Dm]Aadhi hai manzilein,        [C]Aadha hai jahaan
[Am]Tera hoon jaan le,        [C]Rooh mujhse baandh le
[Dm]Baanhon mein thaam le,        [C]Kar de zinda
[Em]Har shay mein tu,        Chappe chappe mein [Dm]tu
[Em]Khwahish mein tu,        Qisse qisse mein [Dm]tu
Har zidd mein [G]tu,        Fikron zikron mein [Am]tu
[Am]Tu hi hai aashiqui,        [G]Tu hi awaaragi
[F]Tu hi hai [Em]zindagi,        [Am]Tu hi judaa
[Am]Tu ibtedaa meri,        [G]Tu intehaa meri
[F]Tu hi mera jahaan,        [Am]Tu hi judaa
Repeat as above:        Soundhi si baatein hain
Raahat se naate hain,        Rishta sukoon se phir hai juda
Phir meethi dhoop hai,        Phir teri chhaanv hai
Apni har saans tujhpe doon luta,        Rag rag mein tu
Zarre zarre mein tu,        Nas nas mein tu
Qatre qatre mein tu,        Tujhme hoon main
Mujhme basi hai tu,        Poori hai rehguzar
Poora hai aasmaan,        Poori hai zindagi
Poora jahaan,        Sang tere raasta
Sadiyon ka waasta,        Phir se jeene ki ek tu hi wajah
Tujhme likhi hoon main,        Tujhse judi hoon main
Tu mera rog hai, Tu hi dawaa,        Tu hi hai aashiqui
Tu hi awaaragi,        Hum mauj, humnasheen ab hon zinda
